[I] ASN.1 framework for Lua

[T] lua-asn1 is a Lua framework for defining ASN.1 data types and encoding
[T] and decoding them in DER format.

[U] https://github.com/kunkku/lua-asn1

[A] Lua-asn1 Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS

[V] 2.2.1
[L] MIT

[D] 1b0b5a92f16f394cb13a9e2f7bcd7d16d1ea6eb27efdab06c09fdb6a lua-asn1-2.2.1.tar.gz https://github.com/kunkku/lua-asn1/archive/v2.2.1/

makeinstopt=

. $base/package/*/lua/lua-conf.in

var_append makeopt ' ' "MOD_DIR=$root$pkgdatadir/asn1"
